# mausrun's sprites (docs/mausrun.md, "Art"): 16x16. 1 is the sprite, 2
# its outline (drawn in the outline colour, black in monochrome), . see-
# through; the colours come from the level's theme. gen_sprites.py makes
# sprites.c from this; a copy at /data/mausrun/sprites.zsp replaces
# sprites of the same name when mausrun starts.
